  "description": "JOYSTAR Vintage Kids Bike - Sizes 12\" to 16\"\nStep back in time with modern reliability. The JOYSTAR Vintage Kids Bike combines a classic retro aesthetic with high-performance safety features, making it the perfect companion for girls aged 2-7 as they begin their cycling journey.\n\nElegant retro design meets modern safety: The JOYSTAR Vintage Series.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Crafted for safety and styled for memories, the Vintage series offers a stable foundation for every new rider.\"\nRobust Safety Systems\nConstructed with a premium HI-TEN steel frame, the Vintage bike offers long-lasting durability for active play. It features an intuitive rear coaster brake, allowing children to stop safely by simply pedaling backward, which is ideal for beginners.\n\nEngineered for stability and easy stopping power.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nClassic Retro Style: Features a beautiful step-through frame, leather-look grips, and a signature front wicker basket.\n\nAdjustable Components: The seat post and handlebars adjust easily to grow alongside your child.\n\nSmooth Stability: Equipped with 2.125\" wide pneumatic tires for a comfortable ride over various surfaces.\n\nSafe & Clean: A full chain guard protects little legs and keeps clothes grease-free.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nStart riding sooner! The JOYSTAR Vintage comes 85% pre-assembled. With the included tools and clear instructions, you can have the bike road-ready in just about 20 minutes.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Action\n\nWatch: Building confidence and joy on the JOYSTAR Vintage.\n\nOur Guarantee\nAt JOYSTAR, we stand behind our products with a warranty that ensures your peace of mind:\n\nLifetime Frame Warranty: Steel frames are covered against defects for the original owner.\n\n2-Year Component Coverage: Non-wear parts like forks and handlebars are protected for 2 years.\n\nRegistration Bonus: While the standard warranty is robust, JOYSTAR often extends a Limited Lifetime Warranty to the original owner if the bike is registered on our official website shortly after purchase.\n\nCustomer Support: Our team is ready to assist with any issues or assembly questions to ensure a safe ride.",
